Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=0}========================CHAPTERS AND OPENINGS=====================
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=1}========================CHAPTERS AND OPENINGS=====================
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=2}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 50,0:02:33.18,0:02:36.92,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}but the path that led Luffy\Nto Marineford began long ago.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:36.92,0:02:40.79,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Ten years ago, in fact,\Nin the East Blue.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:42.89,0:02:46.06,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,There lies a small town,\Nknown as Windmill Village,
Dialogue: 50,0:02:46.06,0:02:49.20,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,where people lived\Nquiet, peaceful lives.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:49.20,0:02:54.00,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,But it was the nearby Mount Corvo,\Nwhere few would dare to set foot.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:54.00,0:02:57.71,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,For only the strong could\Nsurvive in its dark woods,
Dialogue: 50,0:02:57.71,0:03:01.21,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,faced with beasts that would\Nmake quick work of trespassers.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:01.78,0:03:06.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with being\Nking of the pirates, Grandpa?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:06.22,0:03:08.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pirates are cool!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:08.86,0:03:10.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And what makes you think I care?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:10.80,0:03:13.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna slap you!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:13.01,0:03:15.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eating that Devil Fruit\Nwasn't enough trouble for you?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:15.71,0:03:17.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Now this nonsense?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:17.01,0:03:19.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}You, and your big brother Ace,
Dialogue: 50,0:03:19.13,0:03:22.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}are both going to become fine\NMarines, you understand me?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:22.20,0:03:23.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Ow, ow, ow you suck!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:23.90,0:03:26.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I thought I was supposed to\Nbe made outta rubber now...
Dialogue: 50,0:03:26.17,0:03:28.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}why does this still hurt so much?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:28.91,0:03:30.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I thought leaving you in a nice village
Dialogue: 50,0:03:30.78,0:03:33.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,would keep you safe,\Nbut pirates won't be satisfied
Dialogue: 50,0:03:33.31,0:03:36.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,until they get their grubby\Nhands on everything!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:37.84,0:03:39.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's this dump?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:41.44,0:03:43.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, shut the hell up!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:43.18,0:03:46.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whatever it is you're sellin',\NI don't want none!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:46.48,0:03:47.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dadan.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:47.42,0:03:49.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:50.52,0:03:52.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Garp! What are you doin' here?!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:05.63,0:04:06.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Charming as ever.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:06.60,0:04:09.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sorry for the cold welcome, but I hope
Dialogue: 50,0:04:09.07,0:04:11.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you don't have another\Nridiculous favor to ask us!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:11.97,0:04:14.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You realize Ace is already ten, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:14.44,0:04:15.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, is he now?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:15.51,0:04:17.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And how's the little scamp doing?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:17.17,0:04:17.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Good?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:17.94,0:04:19.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, he's a handful, of course!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:19.94,0:04:22.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And we've been watching\Nover the brat for long enough!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:22.24,0:04:23.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So just take him away!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:23.84,0:04:24.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Never mind.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:24.74,0:04:26.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's the problem...we do mind!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:26.90,0:04:29.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And speaking of brats,\Nwould you shut that one up?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:29.20,0:04:31.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's yours now.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:31.00,0:04:32.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:32.63,0:04:34.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy, tell 'em hello.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:34.60,0:04:35.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yo!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:35.41,0:04:38.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec, who is he?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:38.15,0:04:40.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's my... grandson.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:40.98,0:04:44.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?! What?!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:44.00,0:04:45.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I never heard about this!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:45.27,0:04:49.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And you want us to take care of the little\Nmonster, uh, little darling, I mean.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:49.64,0:04:51.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, no way!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:51.14,0:04:51.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:51.91,0:04:53.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then I'll give you two choices:
Dialogue: 50,0:04:53.24,0:04:57.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can either raise my grandson\Nor spend your life in prison.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:57.10,0:04:59.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pretty generous, considering\Nall the crimes you've committed.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:02.23,0:05:04.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No fair!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:04.10,0:05:06.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The thing is, I'd rather\Nstay outta the slammer.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:06.97,0:05:09.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Frankly, if you asked me\Nthat on one of Ace's bad days,
Dialogue: 50,0:05:09.91,0:05:12.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I might have to go for\Nthe prison option after all.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:12.44,0:05:13.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And two brats?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:13.48,0:05:15.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I don't think so.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:15.10,0:05:17.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This kid looks like\Na real charmer, too.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:17.94,0:05:19.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Like your face?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:19.18,0:05:21.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You wanna fight, you little punk?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:21.94,0:05:22.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So rude!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:22.60,0:05:23.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}– Dadan!\N– Dadan!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:23.44,0:05:25.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't let him get to you!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:25.08,0:05:25.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the heck?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:25.95,0:05:26.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ew!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:26.65,0:05:27.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Spit!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:27.57,0:05:28.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's gross!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:28.94,0:05:30.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who did that?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:31.14,0:05:31.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:31.84,0:05:33.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You jerk!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:33.34,0:05:35.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You better apologize for that!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:35.64,0:05:36.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:36.34,0:05:37.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There he is!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:37.55,0:05:40.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, hello, Ace, welcome back!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:45.72,0:05:47.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm waiting!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:49.39,0:05:51.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy, This here is Ace.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:51.61,0:05:53.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's three years older than you.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:53.41,0:05:56.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anyway, you're gonna be living\Nwith him and Dadan from now on.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:57.31,0:05:59.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What? Not so fast!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:05.14,0:06:06.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You play nice.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:06.14,0:06:07.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We said, "No"!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:07.71,0:06:09.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You'll do it.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:11.38,0:06:13.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sir, as you wish, sir!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:14.23,0:06:15.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's your turn to do the dishes.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:16.50,0:06:17.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Old man.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:17.20,0:06:18.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can I have some more?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:18.71,0:06:21.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm a woman, thank you very much!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:21.00,0:06:23.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do you even know where you are\Nright now, you filthy little urchin?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:23.91,0:06:24.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:24.61,0:06:25.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay, then I'll tell you.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:25.91,0:06:29.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is the den of the Dadan Family...\Nmountain bandits that rule Mount Corvo!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:29.97,0:06:31.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mountain bandits?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:31.34,0:06:32.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bluh.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:32.08,0:06:34.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mountain bandits are lame.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:35.15,0:06:36.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, you're stuck with us!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:36.98,0:06:40.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Or rather, we're stuck with you,\Nthanks to that pushy grandfather of yours!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:40.41,0:06:42.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But if you don't want to stay,\Nthat's fine by me...
Dialogue: 50,0:06:42.38,0:06:44.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,go get eaten by a bunch\Nof wolves for all I care!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:44.82,0:06:46.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Easy, Boss. Easy.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:46.88,0:06:49.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I just wanted s'more rice.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:50.39,0:06:51.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Or meat.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:51.15,0:06:53.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Meat would be nice.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:00.01,0:07:03.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In case you didn't notice, all this meat\Ncame from that bison Ace brought back.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:03.73,0:07:07.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even though he's a kid like you,\Nhe has to work to earn his keep.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:07.11,0:07:09.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The bandit life's a hard one, boy.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:09.18,0:07:12.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow, you're gonna pay\Nin blood, sweat, and tears:
Dialogue: 50,0:07:12.79,0:07:16.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cleaning, doing laundry,\Npolishing our boots and weapons,
Dialogue: 50,0:07:16.57,0:07:19.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,robbery, fraud, murder, and terror!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:19.89,0:07:22.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And if you go crying\Nto your dear old grandpa,
Dialogue: 50,0:07:22.54,0:07:25.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,we'll string you up\Nwithout a second thought!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:25.07,0:07:29.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,One bowl of rice and one glass of water,\Nthat's all I can promise you.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:29.61,0:07:31.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The rest you get for yourself.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:31.98,0:07:34.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're gonna have\Nto grow up real fast, kid.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:34.18,0:07:36.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Or you'll go hungry\Nbefore the week's up.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:36.19,0:07:37.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No problem.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:37.25,0:07:40.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"No problem"? Not crying\Nand begging for mercy?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:40.39,0:07:44.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Grandpa threw me in the jungle one time,\Nso I know how to tough it out just fine.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:44.21,0:07:46.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's plenty of water to drink\Nand I can eat frogs and snakes
Dialogue: 50,0:07:46.94,0:07:49.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and mushrooms and stuff all I want.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:49.52,0:07:53.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be a pirate someday,\Nso I gotta be strong!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:53.29,0:07:55.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is gonna be real fun!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:55.94,0:07:56.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Boss!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:56.65,0:07:57.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You okay?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:57.51,0:07:59.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hurry! Help her up!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:59.05,0:08:01.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Heave-ho!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:02.41,0:08:03.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:03.11,0:08:04.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why is he leaving?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:04.14,0:08:05.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,One more!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:07.01,0:08:08.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, get back here, you!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:08.48,0:08:11.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hold on, what d'you mean\Nyou're gonna be a pirate?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:11.15,0:08:13.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And stop ignoring me!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:13.15,0:08:14.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:18.26,0:08:20.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He just got here,\Nand he's already a pain!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:20.16,0:08:23.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's gonna be like having\Na baby Garp living with us!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:23.03,0:08:26.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, now, it's okay!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:26.02,0:08:27.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:27.66,0:08:29.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait for me!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:31.03,0:08:32.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:34.90,0:08:35.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hi!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:35.60,0:08:37.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My name's Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:37.03,0:08:38.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Everything's cool now!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:38.33,0:08:40.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm not mad about you spitting on me!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:45.00,0:08:46.82,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Why are you all laughing?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:46.82,0:08:49.22,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,But the guy just spilled\Nsome booze on me.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:49.22,0:08:51.46,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,It's not worth getting\Nbent out of shape.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:51.76,0:08:53.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's not worth getting\Nbent out of shape!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:53.46,0:08:55.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'd rather be friends!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:55.66,0:08:57.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So, can I come with you?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:07.17,0:10:09.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? Wait. You're alone?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:09.11,0:10:10.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's not good.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:10.38,0:10:11.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh, yeah.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:11.34,0:10:13.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where's Luffy?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:13.05,0:10:14.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wasn't he with you?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:14.25,0:10:15.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Beats me.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:17.13,0:10:18.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get a hold of yourself!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:18.33,0:10:19.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is serious!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:19.76,0:10:20.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No biggie.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:20.80,0:10:22.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, and is that what\Nyou're gonna say to Garp
Dialogue: 50,0:10:22.67,0:10:24.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,when he finds out we\Nlet his grandson die?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:24.70,0:10:25.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why do you care?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:25.57,0:10:27.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,One less crappy brat in the world.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:28.63,0:10:29.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Y'know what?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:29.50,0:10:32.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,While we're at it, screw Ace, too!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:33.87,0:10:37.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If he dies, we'll\Ntell Garp it was an accident.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:37.17,0:10:39.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I mean, that'd be\Nthe truth, wouldn't it?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:39.98,0:10:41.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The devil's children\Nhave the devil's luck!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:41.98,0:10:43.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How 'bout that?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:43.01,0:10:46.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,'Cause Ace is\Nthe devil's son, for sure.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:46.22,0:10:49.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What do you think the Government\Nwould do if they found out about him?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:49.75,0:10:50.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hah!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:50.52,0:10:51.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll take my chances with Garp!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:51.99,0:10:54.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, you don't mean that, Boss.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:54.66,0:10:56.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come on, that's the booze talking.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:56.83,0:10:58.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just sleep it off.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:01.10,0:11:02.68,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,One week later.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:02.98,0:11:05.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Boss! Wake up! C'mere, quick!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:07.05,0:11:07.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:07.98,0:11:09.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:09.48,0:11:10.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's you!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:10.59,0:11:12.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The little bugger isn't dead after all!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:18.41,0:11:20.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're alive.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:20.41,0:11:22.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why'd you scare us like that?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:22.45,0:11:23.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:23.15,0:11:24.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Easy, easy, Boss.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:24.65,0:11:26.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where the hell were you,\Nand what were you doing?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:26.65,0:11:30.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, now, just give him a second... he'll\Nanswer without all the face stretching.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:30.56,0:11:34.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I was stuck at the bottom of the\Nvalley getting chased by wolves.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:34.32,0:11:35.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you nuts?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:35.39,0:11:38.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the heck were you\Ntrying to do down there?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:40.72,0:11:41.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, whatever.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:41.68,0:11:43.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's good you came back safe.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:43.72,0:11:45.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's nothing good about it!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:45.73,0:11:48.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Another useless mouth to feed!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:49.26,0:11:50.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get some sleep while you can.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:50.43,0:11:53.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're putting you to work\Nbright and early tomorrow!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:04.08,0:12:05.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Ace!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:05.28,0:12:07.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You going somewhere fun today?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:07.21,0:12:08.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Take me!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:08.55,0:12:12.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know I was gone for a while,\Nbut I still wanna be friends!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:12.82,0:12:13.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:13.99,0:12:16.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Boss! He's running after Ace again!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:16.73,0:12:17.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:17.73,0:12:21.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get back here...you\Nstill have chores to do!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:21.40,0:12:24.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nyah! I'm outta here!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:25.20,0:12:27.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I am gonna wring your\Nrotten neck, you twerp!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:27.80,0:12:28.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Easy, easy!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:28.94,0:12:31.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You shut your yapper\Nand go bring him back!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:31.01,0:12:31.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:51.60,0:12:54.33,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,It was the same thing every time.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:57.60,0:12:59.87,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,But that didn't deter him one bit.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:59.87,0:13:01.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ace!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:09.68,0:13:11.88,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,A month passed.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:11.88,0:13:14.38,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Two months.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:14.38,0:13:15.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait up!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:15.79,0:13:17.89,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,In the rain.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:17.89,0:13:19.52,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Or in the wind.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:21.86,0:13:23.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's be friends!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:23.79,0:13:26.90,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Ace would run\Nand Luffy would chase him.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:47.32,0:13:49.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm having a tough\Ntime losing him today.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:49.52,0:13:51.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stubborn punk.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:53.06,0:13:54.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:54.33,0:13:55.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Crap!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:55.01,0:13:55.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This sucks!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:55.96,0:13:57.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Got away again!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:57.03,0:13:59.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How'd he get so darn fast?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:00.33,0:14:02.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, there you are!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:10.64,0:14:13.04,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,That's gotta be the\Nnastiest monster in the forest.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:13.04,0:14:15.21,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Even I can't beat that thing!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:17.91,0:14:19.08,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Run away, stupid!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:19.08,0:14:20.41,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,It's gonna eat you!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:29.62,0:15:31.25,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Three months had passed, and although
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.30,0:15:45.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The end of the forest.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:31.25,0:15:36.01,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,he was covered with cuts and\Nbruises, Luffy did not relent.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.92,0:15:52.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is this place?!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:52.99,0:15:57.66,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,On the North side of Mount Corvo,\Nnot far from where Dadan's bandits live,
Dialogue: 50,0:15:57.66,0:16:00.36,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,there is a surprise\Nat the end of the forest.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:00.36,0:16:05.74,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Covered in a thick mist, piles\Nof trash reach toward the heavens.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:05.74,0:16:09.24,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,It is a place where\Nthe unwanted gather.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:09.24,0:16:12.84,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,That goes for the refuse as well\Nas those who reside there,
Dialogue: 50,0:16:12.84,0:16:15.51,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,rogues cast out by society.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:15.51,0:16:17.68,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,It is a den of lawlessness.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:17.68,0:16:23.02,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Crime and disease run rampant, with\Nneither Marines nor doctors present.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:23.02,0:16:27.28,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,This place is known as "Gray Terminal."
Dialogue: 50,0:16:27.28,0:16:29.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just a bunch of junk.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:29.01,0:16:30.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gotta be something.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:30.45,0:16:32.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:33.12,0:16:35.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:35.08,0:16:36.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Finally!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:36.52,0:16:37.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fork it over!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:37.39,0:16:38.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right! That's mine!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:38.75,0:16:39.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Screw you!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:39.61,0:16:41.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I found it!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:41.34,0:16:43.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're gonna break it, you idiots!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:43.21,0:16:45.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's cool man,\NI just wanna cash it in for you!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:46.21,0:16:47.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:47.21,0:16:49.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,C'mon, just gimme one pearl!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:57.72,0:16:59.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Back off!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:01.43,0:17:03.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can only blame yourself.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:03.06,0:17:06.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Next time, let's try this\Nwithout all the running.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:06.34,0:17:07.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:07.01,0:17:09.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look what I found!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:09.01,0:17:10.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:10.01,0:17:12.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get back here!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:13.85,0:17:15.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thief!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:20.70,0:17:21.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:21.43,0:17:23.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Move it, you brat!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:24.44,0:17:25.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is your problem?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:25.90,0:17:27.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You want some of this?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:27.87,0:17:29.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He went that way!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:35.74,0:17:36.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sabo!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:36.74,0:17:38.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you up there?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:40.38,0:17:43.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh. What's up, Ace?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:43.08,0:17:44.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sorry I'm a little late this time.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:44.75,0:17:47.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}More than "a little." I went out there.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:47.59,0:17:50.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}and made a killing already today.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:50.19,0:17:51.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Heh.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:51.52,0:17:52.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Heh.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:52.53,0:17:53.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:53.63,0:17:55.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, maybe I did too.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:55.36,0:17:57.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}– Let's see!\N– Let's see!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:57.29,0:17:58.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Dude!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:58.83,0:18:00.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You got more than me!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:00.46,0:18:02.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's a ton of cash!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:02.53,0:18:03.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:03.97,0:18:05.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Some chumps near the gate.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:05.77,0:18:07.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robbed 'em blind and made a run for it.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:07.80,0:18:09.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hah! Well, crap!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:09.43,0:18:11.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Guess you win again, buddy!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:11.23,0:18:13.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter\Nif you "win" or "lose."
Dialogue: 50,0:18:13.53,0:18:17.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We've got five years of\N"pirate savings" piled up.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:17.17,0:18:20.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We should both be happy about that.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:22.92,0:18:25.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We worked pretty hard.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:25.42,0:18:28.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, no kidding.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:28.09,0:18:32.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll leave this dump behind and go\Nplaces these chumps never even dreamed of.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:32.79,0:18:34.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is all gonna be worth it.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:34.63,0:18:36.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just you wait.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:42.38,0:18:43.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'd better put it away now.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:43.88,0:18:45.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can't let anyone else see this.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:45.82,0:18:47.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So how much is a ship?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:47.55,0:18:50.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I want a good one, but\Nseems like we're pretty rich.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:50.32,0:18:51.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:51.25,0:18:54.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Could take 10 million, maybe even more.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:54.06,0:18:55.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't rush it.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:55.53,0:18:59.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Did you say "ship"?\NYou're gonna be pirates?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:59.00,0:19:01.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And you've got hidden treasure already?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:01.62,0:19:05.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be a pirate too! Yay!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:13.73,0:19:17.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}– Shut up!\N– Shut up!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:19.63,0:19:20.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Know what's cool?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:20.94,0:19:24.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now that I know where you go,\NI can follow you every day!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:24.07,0:19:25.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:25.11,0:19:26.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:26.74,0:19:28.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is the brat you\Nwere talking about.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:28.81,0:19:29.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:29.97,0:19:31.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Does that mean you\Ntold your friends about me?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:31.64,0:19:34.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I was telling my friend\Nhow annoying you were.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:34.40,0:19:37.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He also told me that\Nyour head's full of rocks.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:37.41,0:19:39.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Head rocks!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:39.87,0:19:42.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You do realize we're messing\Nwith you here, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:42.88,0:19:45.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The route I took here\Nwasn't easy to follow.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:45.51,0:19:48.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I knew he was hard-headed, but\NI didn't think he was so tough.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:48.68,0:19:51.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So great that Ace\Nhas other friends too!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:51.18,0:19:53.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I bet we're all gonna be best pals!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:53.26,0:19:54.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm not your "pal."
Dialogue: 50,0:19:54.63,0:19:56.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You don't even know my name, stupid!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:56.70,0:19:57.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,'Kay.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:57.37,0:19:58.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then what is your name?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:58.67,0:19:59.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's Sa...
Dialogue: 50,0:19:59.67,0:20:01.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,a secret!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:01.17,0:20:02.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I told you, didn't I?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:02.73,0:20:04.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You need to live here!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:04.24,0:20:09.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The mountains made you tough, but at this\Nrate, our whole plan's gonna be ruined.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:09.02,0:20:11.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:11.89,0:20:13.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He knows our secret.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:13.71,0:20:16.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can't trust him\Nto keep his mouth shut.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:16.31,0:20:18.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's too stupid.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:23.42,0:20:24.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll kill him.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:24.59,0:20:25.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:25.56,0:20:26.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sounds good.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:28.58,0:20:31.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:31.45,0:20:33.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop, this is scary!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:33.62,0:20:35.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Somebody help me!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:35.68,0:20:37.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna die!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:37.45,0:20:39.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gimme a break! This kid is the worst!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:39.19,0:20:40.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just kill 'im already!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:40.46,0:20:41.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hurry it up!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:41.46,0:20:43.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's your problem...\Nwhy don't you do it?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:43.49,0:20:45.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Because I've never killed\Nanyone before, okay?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:45.83,0:20:47.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, neither have I!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:47.16,0:20:48.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't know how this crap works!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:51.79,0:20:53.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay! The river!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:53.13,0:20:55.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's convenient,\Nbut why did he say that?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:55.56,0:20:56.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I told you, he's stupid!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:56.63,0:20:59.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Somebody help me!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:59.13,0:21:00.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}– That's enough!\N– That's enough!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:02.93,0:21:04.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't kill me!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:05.60,0:21:06.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait listen.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:06.33,0:21:07.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I just heard some screaming.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:07.57,0:21:08.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sounded like a kid.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:08.81,0:21:09.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aw, damn it.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:09.77,0:21:11.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Somebody heard him!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:11.31,0:21:12.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Set him free.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:12.18,0:21:13.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We gotta get outta here and fast.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:13.70,0:21:17.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If people start snooping around,\Nthey'll find our treasure.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:18.98,0:21:23.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sounds like you're talking about Ace and\NSabo... those two're infamous around here.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:23.70,0:21:25.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}And the one who took your money.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:25.70,0:21:26.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}That was Ace, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:26.97,0:21:28.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}The kid who had the\Nblack hair, you said?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:28.64,0:21:29.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:29.67,0:21:31.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is real pathetic, I know.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:31.38,0:21:32.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We both got sloppy.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:32.88,0:21:35.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's either cocky or dumb.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:35.04,0:21:38.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can't rob pirates blind\Nand expect to get away with it.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:38.38,0:21:40.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bottom line is, if we\Ndon't get that money back,
Dialogue: 50,0:21:40.41,0:21:44.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Captain Bluejam's gonna skin\Nus alive, and I mean literally.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:45.78,0:21:46.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bluejam?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:46.78,0:21:48.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Crap!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:48.02,0:21:50.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How was I s'posed to know\Nthey were workin' with him?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:50.18,0:21:51.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You robbed those guys?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:51.62,0:21:53.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to\Nget us killed or what?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:53.65,0:21:54.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:54.56,0:21:57.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is not gonna end well.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:57.21,0:21:58.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That sword looks sharp.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:58.51,0:22:00.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,though you probably saw that already.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:01.58,0:22:03.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The guy with 'em is Porchemy.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:03.69,0:22:05.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's crazy.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:05.52,0:22:07.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lose a fight with him.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:07.26,0:22:10.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And he'll scalp you alive\Njust to hear you scream.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:13.86,0:22:16.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just lay low and\Nlet 'em pass by for now.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:18.03,0:22:18.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:18.87,0:22:20.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's gone.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:22.57,0:22:24.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You better put me down\Nright now, you big jerk!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:24.14,0:22:26.41,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}– How did he get caught already?\N– How did he get caught already?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:26.98,0:22:28.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who the hell is this?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:28.74,0:22:29.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This guy won't put me down!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:29.98,0:22:32.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ace, help!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:32.95,0:22:34.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ace! Why aren't you saving me?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:34.58,0:22:35.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're friends, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:35.28,0:22:36.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We should've killed him.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:36.95,0:22:38.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now we're all dead!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:40.50,0:22:43.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So, you know Ace, do ya?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:43.51,0:22:44.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:44.67,0:22:48.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And if you cry, do ya\Nthink he'll come for ya?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:49.14,0:22:51.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, 'cause we're friends.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:51.55,0:22:55.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Except he just tried\Nto kill me, so maybe not.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:55.58,0:22:56.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:56.42,0:22:58.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:58.75,0:23:00.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If he's your friend,\Nmaybe you can help us.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:00.82,0:23:02.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,See, Ace stole our money.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:02.75,0:23:06.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And if we got it back, we\Nwouldn't have to hurt anybody.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:06.25,0:23:09.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You don't happen to\Nknow where it is, do ya?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:13.99,0:23:14.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're screwed!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:14.99,0:23:17.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're gonna take\Nour treasure for sure!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:17.26,0:23:20.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,For once in your life, please shut up.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:29.04,0:23:31.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't know!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:31.04,0:23:32.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:32.91,0:23:34.64,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,What a crappy liar!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:38.84,0:23:40.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right, fine.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:40.21,0:23:43.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you just forgot.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:46.01,0:23:49.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I have ways\Nof jogging your memory.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:50.85,0:23:52.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I told you I don't know!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:52.18,0:23:54.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let go of me, you dumb jerk!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:54.35,0:23:56.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ace is gonna kick your butt,\NI'm telling you!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:56.52,0:23:57.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're in big
Dialogue: 50,0:23:58.24,0:23:59.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,'Kay, so now what?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:59.74,0:24:01.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop asking me!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:01.24,0:24:02.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You know what!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:11.12,0:24:12.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lemme go!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:12.76,0:24:15.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm not telling you a darn thing!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:22.97,0:24:24.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You little punk!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:39.06,0:24:42.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Gum-Gum Fruit turned me into rubber,\Nso that stuff's not gonna work on me!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:42.96,0:24:45.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Calm down!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:45.66,0:24:47.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A Devil Fruit, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:47.80,0:24:49.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Heh.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:49.33,0:24:51.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know how to deal with that.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:53.63,0:24:56.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bring me my pair of gloves.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:56.27,0:24:58.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:58.10,0:24:58.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hurry, man!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:58.77,0:24:59.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Faster!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:59.80,0:25:01.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're screwed if those guys come back!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:01.47,0:25:04.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We gotta move all this,\Nbut I don't know where.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:04.66,0:25:08.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy's pretty stubborn, but it's only\Na matter of time before he rats us out.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:08.64,0:25:11.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm not losing our pirate savings\Nto those jerks, or anyone else!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:11.98,0:25:13.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It took us five years\Nto score all this!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:13.97,0:25:16.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can't get stuck\Nin this dump forever!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:21.45,0:25:23.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll try to clear this up a little.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:23.35,0:25:25.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The money Ace stole isn't\Njust some chump change,
Dialogue: 50,0:25:25.95,0:25:29.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,it's a matter of life and death\Nfor me and all of my buddies here.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:29.39,0:25:32.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And you're gonna tell me where it is.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:32.53,0:25:36.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even if I gotta beat it outta you.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:36.40,0:25:38.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Will not!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:46.01,0:25:47.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's rough!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:51.11,0:25:54.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm warnin' you, kid.\NYou don't piss off a pirate.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:54.28,0:25:59.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}If I don't kick your ass, Captain Bluejam's\Ngonna kill you and all of us, too.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:05.03,0:26:06.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let me go!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:06.90,0:26:09.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're hurting me!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:09.03,0:26:10.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Somebody help!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:13.80,0:26:15.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We don't have time\Nto stand around, you idiots!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:15.77,0:26:18.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go look for Ace and Sabo while\NI take care of this one!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:18.77,0:26:20.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[HOODLUMS Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:28.21,0:26:29.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ace and Sabo, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:29.78,0:26:31.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I know 'em.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:31.25,0:26:32.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, I get it.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:32.22,0:26:34.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're from the city.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:34.88,0:26:36.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Leave those two be.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:36.62,0:26:38.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you were locals, you'd understand.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:38.78,0:26:41.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They may be kids,\Nbut they're also crazy.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:41.28,0:26:44.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, man, they got claws\Nlike a tiger, if you cross 'em.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:44.55,0:26:46.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ace and Sabo, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:46.25,0:26:48.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't know.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:48.38,0:26:50.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But while we're\Nhaving this little chat.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:50.72,0:26:53.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why don't you boys\Nfork over your wallets?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:53.45,0:26:55.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We... We don't want any trouble!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:55.42,0:26:57.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll ask someone else!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:00.95,0:27:03.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Didn't realize it was getting so late.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:03.39,0:27:04.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:04.09,0:27:05.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I finally did it!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:05.59,0:27:08.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not even Luffy knows about this spot!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:11.52,0:27:12.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm back!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:12.48,0:27:13.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:13.45,0:27:14.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I moved everything.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:14.65,0:27:15.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:15.59,0:27:17.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are they poking\Naround at the old place?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:20.19,0:27:22.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, that's the thing.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:22.09,0:27:25.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bluejam's guys are\Nstill out looking for us!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:25.12,0:27:26.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And what does that mean?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:26.32,0:27:28.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you, it's Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:29.65,0:27:32.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All that time and\Nhe still didn't rat us out!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:33.49,0:27:35.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I thought he would,\Nsince he's such an idiot.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:35.89,0:27:38.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That, and he was crying\Nwhenever we left him.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:38.49,0:27:40.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But you know what\Nthis means, don't you?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:40.49,0:27:42.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're torturing him right now!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:44.02,0:27:46.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What if he still doesn't talk?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:54.80,0:27:57.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Getting awful late, isn't it?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:57.66,0:28:00.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who did I leave in charge today?
Dialogue: 50,0:28:00.86,0:28:04.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, Captain Bluejam, if I\Nrecall, it should be Porchemy.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:04.76,0:28:07.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh. Then he'd better hurry.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:09.09,0:28:12.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, surely they made the sale.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:12.06,0:28:14.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It couldn't have taken them that long.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:14.90,0:28:19.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Maybe Porchemy thinks he's clever\Nenough to take my money and skip town.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:19.37,0:28:21.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Of course not, Captain!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:21.04,0:28:24.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I doubt he would throw his life\Naway for some measly treasure.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:24.91,0:28:26.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah...
Dialogue: 50,0:28:26.41,0:28:28.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's hope not.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:32.72,0:28:35.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,C'mon, kid, spit it out.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:38.72,0:28:40.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,W-Wait.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:40.36,0:28:41.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Porchemy, stop it.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:41.73,0:28:43.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't think he's gonna talk.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:47.00,0:28:48.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's shutting down.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:48.17,0:28:51.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The kid's not even\Ncalling for help anymore.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:54.97,0:28:57.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If he was gonna talk,\Nhe would've done it already.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:57.33,0:29:00.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And to be honest, this is\Ngetting kinda hard to watch.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:00.46,0:29:02.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Show the little bastard some mercy!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:05.97,0:29:10.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you have time to bitch about this,\Nthen you have time to go look for Ace!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:10.10,0:29:14.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're the ones who're gonna get\Nkilled here, not the damn kid!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:14.27,0:29:17.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Save your breath, 'cause\Nyou'll be begging for mercy
Dialogue: 50,0:29:17.18,0:29:20.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,from Captain Bluejam soon enough!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:24.68,0:29:26.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're gonna kill that child.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:26.12,0:29:28.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do you think we should call\Nthe sheriff from the city?
Dialogue: 50,0:29:28.95,0:29:30.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no point.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:30.22,0:29:32.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I mean, this place doesn't\Nfall under any country's laws.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:32.85,0:29:36.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Plus, that Porchemy guy's a\Nmember of the Bluejam Pirates.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:36.63,0:29:38.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're paying off\Nthe nobles, you know.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:39.63,0:29:42.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So, in other words, even if they\Ndo get arrested for a crime,
Dialogue: 50,0:29:42.73,0:29:44.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,they're just gonna be\Npardoned in the end.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:44.63,0:29:48.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Besides, what's one more dead\Nbody in a place like this?
Dialogue: 50,0:29:48.34,0:29:50.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nobody gives a damn.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:51.30,0:29:52.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Answer me!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:54.70,0:29:56.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm not talking.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:57.04,0:29:58.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You little punk!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:58.31,0:30:01.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll beat that secret out\Nof you, or I'll beat you dead!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:05.32,0:30:07.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tell me!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:10.36,0:30:12.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I won't do it.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:12.69,0:30:14.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I won't talk.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:14.73,0:30:17.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just let me go.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:20.10,0:30:23.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm not telling you.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:23.82,0:30:24.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:24.79,0:30:26.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Enough of this.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:44.68,0:30:46.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're finished here, brat.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:03.01,0:31:04.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's that damn kid!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:04.31,0:31:05.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's got the money!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:05.58,0:31:06.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That brat!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:07.38,0:31:08.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:31:08.38,0:31:11.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ace! You're here!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:16.12,0:31:17.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thanks for showin' up, kid.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:17.56,0:31:19.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You saved us some trouble.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:19.79,0:31:20.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your friend ain't squealin'.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:20.99,0:31:22.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's pretty tough.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:22.22,0:31:23.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But I think you'll talk!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:23.88,0:31:24.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ace!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:24.65,0:31:28.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,S-Sabo... Do it!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:32.46,0:31:34.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Boss, are you okay?
Dialogue: 50,0:31:36.62,0:31:38.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ace. Sabo.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:38.86,0:31:40.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That kind of hurt.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:40.43,0:31:41.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who hit me?
Dialogue: 50,0:31:41.73,0:31:42.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You?
Dialogue: 50,0:31:44.20,0:31:46.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You punks don't get\Nwho you're messing with!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:46.47,0:31:47.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:47.17,0:31:48.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're all dead meat!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:48.84,0:31:50.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shut your mouth and fight!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:50.70,0:31:51.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sabo!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:51.40,0:31:52.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Help Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:52.31,0:31:53.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You guys.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:54.67,0:31:55.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,One thing.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:55.41,0:31:57.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That ugly dude has a sword!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:57.21,0:31:58.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Be careful!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:10.76,0:32:11.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:11.89,0:32:14.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Porchemy, that other\Nkid got our knife...!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:17.40,0:32:19.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Quick, make a run for it!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:19.60,0:32:20.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You go ahead!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:20.83,0:32:22.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What? Ace!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:22.50,0:32:24.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's just leave!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:24.00,0:32:26.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't run from my enemies.
Dialogue: 50,0:32:26.07,0:32:26.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ever!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:26.87,0:32:28.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Got it?
Dialogue: 50,0:32:28.50,0:32:31.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And I don't go easy on my enemies!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:31.11,0:32:31.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:31.87,0:32:33.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,These guys aren't just thugs!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:33.24,0:32:34.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're Bluejam pirates!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:34.60,0:32:36.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you got that right!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:36.37,0:32:39.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, I'm done playing games here.
Dialogue: 50,0:32:39.37,0:32:41.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You've got something\Nthat belongs to us.
Dialogue: 50,0:32:41.63,0:32:44.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Be good and give it back, you brat!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:44.84,0:32:47.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're just a kid and I don't\Nblame you for actin' stupid,
Dialogue: 50,0:32:47.80,0:32:50.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but fork over the cash\Nor you'll regret it.
Dialogue: 50,0:32:52.50,0:32:54.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We've got better plans for it.
Dialogue: 50,0:32:54.06,0:32:56.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's our money now.
Dialogue: 50,0:32:59.00,0:33:00.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then you are dead!
Dialogue: 50,0:33:00.70,0:33:02.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hold on a sec, I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 50,0:33:10.84,0:33:13.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna lose, ya hear?
Dialogue: 50,0:33:13.30,0:33:15.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'd rather just kill myself!
Dialogue: 50,0:33:15.27,0:33:18.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,675)}Not if we do it first!
Dialogue: 50,0:33:18.24,0:33:20.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come at me, ya pricks!
Dialogue: 50,0:33:29.18,0:33:32.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I heard the whole damn story, Porchemy.
Dialogue: 50,0:33:32.38,0:33:34.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You should be ashamed.
Dialogue: 50,0:33:34.18,0:33:38.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Did you seriously get\Nbeaten by a couple of kids?
Dialogue: 50,0:33:38.52,0:33:39.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 50,0:33:39.52,0:33:41.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Forgive me, Captain.
Dialogue: 50,0:33:41.99,0:33:42.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The money...
Dialogue: 50,0:33:42.72,0:33:44.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've heard enough of this!
Dialogue: 50,0:33:44.12,0:33:45.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're not fit for my crew!
Dialogue: 50,0:33:57.78,0:34:00.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ace, that was really not cool.
Dialogue: 50,0:34:00.22,0:34:02.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Those guys were actual pirates!
Dialogue: 50,0:34:02.16,0:34:03.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Next time, we run.
Dialogue: 50,0:34:03.82,0:34:07.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whatever your deal is,\Nit's not worth dying over.
Dialogue: 50,0:34:07.09,0:34:08.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This sucks.
Dialogue: 50,0:34:08.16,0:34:11.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I liked my old one better.
Dialogue: 50,0:34:12.42,0:34:14.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We made a huge mistake.
Dialogue: 50,0:34:14.11,0:34:16.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pissing off pirates like that, man.
Dialogue: 50,0:34:16.18,0:34:17.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They probably told their captain.
Dialogue: 50,0:34:17.98,0:34:19.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What are we supposed to do now?
Dialogue: 50,0:34:19.85,0:34:21.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That was scary!
Dialogue: 50,0:34:21.11,0:34:24.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I thought I was gonna die!
Dialogue: 50,0:34:27.22,0:34:28.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Would you shut up?
Dialogue: 50,0:34:28.38,0:34:29.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're not hurt that bad!
Dialogue: 50,0:34:29.62,0:34:31.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So, stop crying already!
Dialogue: 50,0:34:31.25,0:34:33.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,When're you gonna stop being a baby?
Dialogue: 50,0:34:33.18,0:34:35.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't you want to be pirate?
Dialogue: 50,0:34:37.86,0:34:40.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Th-Thank you!
Dialogue: 50,0:34:45.14,0:34:45.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 50,0:34:45.84,0:34:47.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You saved me!
Dialogue: 50,0:34:47.53,0:34:48.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 50,0:34:48.33,0:34:49.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Calm down!
Dialogue: 50,0:34:49.46,0:34:51.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's just happy, okay?
Dialogue: 50,0:34:54.74,0:34:55.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 50,0:34:55.54,0:34:56.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What gives?
Dialogue: 50,0:34:56.58,0:34:58.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you tell\Nthem what they wanted?
Dialogue: 50,0:34:58.40,0:35:00.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You think they wouldn't kill\Nyou 'cause you're a kid?
Dialogue: 50,0:35:00.94,0:35:03.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Those guys don't give a damn!
Dialogue: 50,0:35:03.43,0:35:07.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I was afraid... that you\Nwouldn't be my friend.
Dialogue: 50,0:35:07.88,0:35:09.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah? Well, so what?
Dialogue: 50,0:35:09.28,0:35:10.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That still beats dying, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:35:10.79,0:35:13.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Besides, why do you\Nwant to be my friend?
Dialogue: 50,0:35:13.17,0:35:15.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's dumb!
Dialogue: 50,0:35:15.72,0:35:17.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Because...
Dialogue: 50,0:35:17.56,0:35:19.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's not like I've been nice to you!
Dialogue: 50,0:35:19.16,0:35:21.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In fact, I've been giving\Nyou hell ever since we met!
Dialogue: 50,0:35:21.70,0:35:22.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's been months!
Dialogue: 50,0:35:22.73,0:35:24.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why haven't you just given up?
Dialogue: 50,0:35:30.25,0:35:31.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 50,0:35:31.59,0:35:32.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,'Cause...
Dialogue: 50,0:35:32.59,0:35:35.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,'Cause I... I got no\None else to turn to!
Dialogue: 50,0:35:35.69,0:35:38.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't go back to Windmill Village!
Dialogue: 50,0:35:38.26,0:35:40.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't like the\Nmountain bandits, either!
Dialogue: 50,0:35:40.53,0:35:43.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'd be alone all the time\Nif I didn't follow you!
Dialogue: 50,0:35:43.76,0:35:48.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Getting beat up hurts,\Nbut being lonely hurts more!
Dialogue: 50,0:35:48.83,0:35:50.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Alone? Why?
Dialogue: 50,0:35:50.77,0:35:53.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gramps is all I have.
Dialogue: 50,0:35:54.32,0:35:56.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You feel better around me?
Dialogue: 50,0:35:56.32,0:35:57.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 50,0:35:57.92,0:35:59.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Otherwise you feel lonely?
Dialogue: 50,0:35:59.70,0:36:01.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 50,0:36:03.70,0:36:06.20,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Do I think Gold Roger had a kid?
Dialogue: 50,0:36:07.60,0:36:10.32,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,If he did, then too bad\Nfor that poor runt!
Dialogue: 50,0:36:10.32,0:36:11.12,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,No kidding!
Dialogue: 50,0:36:11.12,0:36:12.48,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,They'd put him to death!
Dialogue: 50,0:36:12.48,0:36:14.43,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,He'd probably deserve it too!
Dialogue: 50,0:36:14.43,0:36:15.80,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,I bet!
Dialogue: 50,0:36:21.63,0:36:25.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do you think I deserve to live?
Dialogue: 50,0:36:27.57,0:36:28.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 50,0:36:28.33,0:36:31.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Of course I do!
Dialogue: 50,0:36:31.20,0:36:35.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 50,0:36:35.28,0:36:36.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But you're still annoying.
Dialogue: 50,0:36:36.61,0:36:39.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Weak little crybabies piss me off.
Dialogue: 50,0:36:40.65,0:36:41.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nuh-uh.
Dialogue: 50,0:36:41.48,0:36:42.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm not weak!
Dialogue: 50,0:36:42.58,0:36:44.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm really strong!
Dialogue: 50,0:36:44.08,0:36:44.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 50,0:36:44.95,0:36:46.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You think you're really strong?
Dialogue: 50,0:36:46.35,0:36:48.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You were crying your eyes out\Nthe whole time you were tied up!
Dialogue: 50,0:36:48.95,0:36:51.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Have you ever gotten hit\Nby a spiky thing that big?
Dialogue: 50,0:36:51.88,0:36:53.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm just seven years old!
Dialogue: 50,0:36:53.35,0:36:55.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait till I turn ten\Nyears old like you guys,
Dialogue: 50,0:36:55.38,0:36:58.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and then I'll be stronger\Nand won't cry anymore!
Dialogue: 50,0:36:58.17,0:37:00.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Age has nothing to\Ndo with it, you brat!
Dialogue: 50,0:37:00.77,0:37:02.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hell, when I was seven I was tough!
Dialogue: 50,0:37:02.78,0:37:03.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So what?
Dialogue: 50,0:37:03.71,0:37:05.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be so tough you're gonna cry!
Dialogue: 50,0:37:05.48,0:37:09.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}I promised Shanks I'd be a great pirate\Nsomeday and that means way greater than you!
Dialogue: 50,0:37:09.27,0:37:11.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ha! You'll be a crappy pirate.
Dialogue: 50,0:37:11.05,0:37:11.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nuh-uh!
Dialogue: 50,0:37:11.65,0:37:12.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah-huh!
Dialogue: 50,0:37:12.35,0:37:13.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nuh-uh!
Dialogue: 50,0:37:14.65,0:37:17.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay, enough of that!
Dialogue: 50,0:37:17.68,0:37:18.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Jeez.
Dialogue: 50,0:37:18.49,0:37:19.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, listen.
Dialogue: 50,0:37:19.55,0:37:22.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In case you guys forgot,\Nwe got a problem here.
Dialogue: 50,0:37:22.02,0:37:22.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A problem?
Dialogue: 50,0:37:24.54,0:37:28.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This forest where I've been living\Nis awfully close to their hideout.
Dialogue: 50,0:37:28.14,0:37:29.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the Cove of Pirates.
Dialogue: 50,0:37:29.63,0:37:33.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What if one night I'm a little too\Ntired, sleep a little too hard,
Dialogue: 50,0:37:33.28,0:37:34.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and they sneak up on me?
Dialogue: 50,0:37:53.99,0:37:55.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's with all the bandages?
Dialogue: 50,0:37:55.59,0:37:58.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Have they been fighting\Nbears or something?
Dialogue: 50,0:38:00.40,0:38:02.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's not the problem.
Dialogue: 50,0:38:06.79,0:38:07.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Boss!
Dialogue: 50,0:38:07.99,0:38:09.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come quick!
Dialogue: 50,0:38:09.02,0:38:10.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This isn't good!
Dialogue: 50,0:38:10.45,0:38:11.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 50,0:38:11.29,0:38:13.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gimme a sec, it's early.
Dialogue: 50,0:38:13.16,0:38:14.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:38:14.66,0:38:17.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What have those brats been up to now?
Dialogue: 50,0:38:17.29,0:38:18.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,One.
Dialogue: 50,0:38:18.13,0:38:19.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Two.
Dialogue: 50,0:38:21.62,0:38:24.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ace! Luffy! Who's\Nthat other kid with you?
Dialogue: 50,0:38:26.16,0:38:28.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who's what now?
Dialogue: 50,0:38:31.14,0:38:33.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ugh! Two brats is already too many!
Dialogue: 50,0:38:33.95,0:38:36.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 50,0:38:36.35,0:38:39.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You mean me?
Dialogue: 50,0:38:39.35,0:38:40.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 50,0:38:40.05,0:38:41.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 50,0:38:41.12,0:38:42.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hi! I'm Sabo!
Dialogue: 50,0:38:42.89,0:38:43.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:38:43.72,0:38:44.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ace's friend?
Dialogue: 50,0:38:44.89,0:38:46.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 50,0:38:46.02,0:38:46.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, good!
Dialogue: 50,0:38:46.93,0:38:48.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's like I'm already living here!
Dialogue: 50,0:38:48.39,0:38:50.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And you must be Dadan, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:38:50.06,0:38:51.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hiya!
Dialogue: 50,0:38:51.52,0:38:55.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're just as worthless as those\Nother two low-lifes moochin' off me!
Dialogue: 50,0:38:55.12,0:38:56.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 50,0:38:56.39,0:38:58.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, I heard that you're\Na worthless old hag yourself!
Dialogue: 50,0:39:09.19,0:39:11.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy! Ace! Sabo!
Dialogue: 50,0:39:11.39,0:39:12.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There aren't any free rides!
Dialogue: 50,0:39:12.99,0:39:15.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You twerps better be grateful\Nand get to work this instant!
Dialogue: 50,0:39:17.03,0:39:19.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You got it! Thank you!
Dialogue: 50,0:39:29.38,0:39:32.35,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Fearing for his life,\NSabo left Gray Terminal
Dialogue: 50,0:39:32.35,0:39:37.32,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,and found a home with Ace and\NLuffy, much to Dadan's dismay.
Dialogue: 50,0:39:37.32,0:39:41.39,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,For the three unwanted guests,\Nit was a never-ending party.
Dialogue: 50,0:39:41.39,0:39:44.39,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Making any excuse to get\Nout of their daily chores,
Dialogue: 50,0:39:44.39,0:39:48.93,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,they hunted wild animals in the mountains,\Ntussled with hooligans in the city,
Dialogue: 50,0:39:48.93,0:39:52.07,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,and dueled with pirates at the cove.
Dialogue: 50,0:39:52.07,0:39:56.34,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Within time, news of their wild\Nexploits reached far and wide,
Dialogue: 50,0:39:56.34,0:39:59.61,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,even over the high walls surrounding\Nthe center of the kingdom.
